  'worldGen.stage.concept_intake': 'Friendly world-gen stage label (status card): the pipeline is reading/interpreting the player\'s freeform world concept. Terse, ~2-4 words, present continuous.',
  'worldGen.stage.world_color': 'Friendly world-gen stage label (status card): the pipeline is setting the world\'s tone/palette/mood. Terse, ~2-4 words, present continuous.',
