  'campaign.noAccess.title': "Calm headline on the campaign page (/campaigns/:id) no-access dead end — the status stream returned 403/404 (the campaign doesn't exist, or the viewer isn't a member). A quiet dead end, not an apology. Terse, ~3-5 words, no blame.",
  'campaign.noAccess.body': 'Calm body under the campaign no-access headline: the campaign may not exist or the viewer may lack access, with a nudge back home. ~1 short sentence, no blame, no retry nudge (retrying can\'t grant access).',
