  'shared.lowCredits': 'Consolidated low-session-credits nudge (one shared string across the site). Aliased via $t() by home.card.lowCredits, campaignNew.guided.credits, campaignNew.preview.credits. ~8 words, no blame.',
  'shared.cooldown': 'Consolidated rate-limit cooldown line after repeated tries. Aliased via $t() by campaignNew.freeform.cooldown, campaignNew.guided.cooldown, campaignNew.preview.cooldown. ~1 short sentence.',
  'shared.draftCost': 'Consolidated disclosure at a SYNTHESIS trigger \u2014 the cheap proposal step, ~a minute, everything still revisable. Aliased via $t() by campaignNew.guided.cost and (since myth-6t06f) campaignNew.freeform.cost, which now drafts a proposal rather than buying the world. Distinct from the preview screen\'s cost line, which discloses the real multi-minute build. ~1 short sentence.',
  'shared.interrupted': 'Consolidated transient-interruption retry line ("the weave" register). Aliased via $t() by campaignNew.guided.retry, campaignNew.preview.retry, campaignNew.synthesizing.failed. ~1 short sentence.',
  'shared.rejected': 'Consolidated concept-rejection fallback (no server-authored reason). Aliased via $t() by campaignNew.rejection.fallback. ~1 short sentence, no blame.',
  'shared.somethingWrong': 'Consolidated generic transient-failure retry line. Aliased via $t() by startingLevel.error, startingSituation.error, characterCreate.freeform.error, characterCreate.reveal.actionError, characterCreate.staging.beginError. Terse.',
  'shared.tryAgain': 'Consolidated retry affordance label. Aliased via $t() by the many *.retry / tryAgain leaves across the app (worldGen, join, play, campaignNew, characterCreate, campaign, error). ~1-2 words.',
  'shared.wait.minutes': 'The COARSE minute-granular {{time}} fill for the waiting countdowns (world-gen, character creation, session prep) — how the remaining wait reads at a minute or more. Interpolates {{count}} (a whole number of minutes) and is dropped mid-sentence into "Ready in {{time}}", e.g. "about 2 min" → "Ready in about 2 min" — hence the hedging "about" and the lowercase start (ux-run2 myth-uz1bn: coarse phrasing everywhere). Deliberately coarse (no ticking seconds — false precision); terse, mechanical, ~2-3 words.',
  'shared.wait.stalled': 'The shared indeterminate "still working" line a waiting surface shows in place of the countdown once its estimate exhausts (or, with no history, after a wall-clock window) — so a wait never sits at a dead 0:00 and "has it broken?" always has an answer. Used by the between-sessions session-prep hold and both world-gen waiting surfaces. Sentence-case, calm, no blame, no retry ask, unhurried — the pipeline retries on its own. Mirrors characterCreate.loading.stalled.',
  'shared.wait.underMinute': 'The COARSE {{time}} fill for the waiting countdowns when under a minute remains — dropped mid-sentence into "Ready in {{time}}" → "Ready in under a minute", hence the lowercase start. Terse, calm, ~3 words; no digits (a ticking sub-minute count reads as anxious false precision).',
  'shared.beginAgain': 'Consolidated "start fresh" affordance label. No longer aliased \u2014 every start-over label moved to literal "Start over" (ux-run2 restart contract); kept for future reuse. ~1-2 words.',
